Refinamento das estruturas com mopac em região QM maior
--------------------------------
#INPUT_TYPE pkl step04/rta_qmmm_opt_am1.pkl
#RUN_SIMULATION  Energy_Refinement
#SET_ENERGY_MODEL_QM SMO
#HAMILTONIAN rm1
#SET_QMMM_REGION #center_atom *:WAT.327:O 5.0
#METHODS_SMO am1 pm7
#SOURCE_FOLDER MD_sampled.ptGeo
#LOG_FREQUENCY 10
#CORRECT_QMMM_CHARGES yes
#SOFTWARE mopac
#FOLDER step6/mopacRef
#XNBINS 51
#MOPAC_PATH /opt/mopac/bin/mopac
#MAX_NUM_OF_THREADS 8
